  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Eastern Sea names three top wisdom path Gu Immortals in a saying: Jia Dan sits in twin polar, Hua An hides in Nan Gong, there is also Dragon Head Tortoise, living inside adversity sea. Song Yi Shi’s party treats Dragon Head Tortoise Immortal in adversity sea as one possible equal to Song Jia Dan who could help someone evade his deductions.",
